{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01SAU7t4t35Tg6nyr5o2gDaF", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal-to-quantization-noise_ratio\"}, {\"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.26793\"}, {\"url\": \"https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/?p=4020\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://yuesha.com/zh-hant/xuexi/danci/quantization+noise.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://member.gastown.org/learning/14924353\"}, {\"url\": \"https://webdemo.inue.uni-stuttgart.de/webdemos/02_lectures/uebertragungstechnik_1/quantization/index.php?id=1\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:09.788Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "信号-量化杂讯比 SQNR 单位", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01BNHWEvdcGHkWjzjbYAExXZ", "content": [{"title": "A Quantization-Friendly Separable Convolution for MobileNets", "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.08607"}, {"title": "Signal-to-quantization-noise ratio", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal-to-quantization-noise_ratio"}, {"title": "Digital Signal Processing for Beam Instrumentation", "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.26793"}, {"title": "signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html"}, {"title": "Because the ADC outputs only levels there is inherently noise in the quantized", "url": "https://ccrma.stanford.edu/CCRMA/Courses/252/sensors/node41.html"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/?p=4020"}, {"title": "Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR)", "url": "https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/"}, {"title": "yuesha.com", "url": "https://yuesha.com/zh-hant/xuexi/danci/quantization+noise.html"}, {"title": "member.gastown.org", "url": "https://member.gastown.org/learning/14924353"}, {"title": "uni-stuttgart.de", "url": "https://webdemo.inue.uni-stuttgart.de/webdemos/02_lectures/uebertragungstechnik_1/quantization/index.php?id=1"}]}, "SQNR 的单位是**分贝（dB）**。它本身是信号功率与量化噪声功率的比值，属于无量纲数值，常以 dB 表示。\n\n- 定义上，SQNR 是信号功率与量化噪声功率之比，dB 版本是对该比值取以 10 为底的对数再乘以 10（SQNR = 10·log10(E(x²)/E(n²)) in dB）。\n- 对理想的 N 位均匀量化器，正弦输入的 SQNR 约为 6.02 N + 1.76 dB，因此每增加一位，SQNR 约提高 6 dB（见 for each bit added to a sample, the SQNR goes up by approximately 6 dB）。\n- 实际转换器还会受热噪声、非线性和抖动等影响，使实测值低于理想 SQNR，因此工程上常用有效位数（ENOB）来描述（来源：arxiv 2608.26793）。\n\n注意：搜索结果中有一个来源（vibrationresearch）的文字写作「SNQR」，应为笔误。"], "durationSeconds": 5.806283166000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01SAU7t4t35Tg6nyr5o2gDaF", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDWysNiJX8V31LAK4J5g", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：分贝（dB）。**\n\n信号-量化杂讯比（SQNR）是信号功率和量化噪声功率之比，本身没有量纲，通常用分贝表示。算法是 SQNR = 10·log₁₀(信号功率/噪声功率) dB。理想的 N 位均匀量化器在正弦输入下，SQNR 约为 6.02N + 1.76 dB，所以每多一位大约提高 6 dB。\n\n（只搜了 1 次。）\n\nSources:\n- [Signal-to-quantization-noise ratio – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal-to-quantization-noise_ratio)\n- [Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR) – Vibration Research](https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/)\n- [signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR) – ITWissen](https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1137, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4298, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1137}, "output_tokens": 367, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:50:13.987Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDWys5riQVt9NPm7zYxU"}
