 "result": "**答案：分贝（dB）。**\n\n信号-量化杂讯比（SQNR）是信号功率和量化噪声功率之比，本身没有量纲，通常用分贝表示。算法是 SQNR = 10·log₁₀(信号功率/噪声功率) dB。理想的 N 位均匀量化器在正弦输入下，SQNR 约为 6.02N + 1.76 dB，所以每多一位大约提高 6 dB。\n\n（只搜了 1 次。）\n\nSources:\n- [Signal-to-quantization-noise ratio – Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Signal-to-quantization-noise_ratio)\n- [Signal-to-Quantization Noise Ratio (SQNR) – Vibration Research](https://vru.vibrationresearch.com/lesson/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-sqnr/)\n- [signal to quantization noise ratio (SQNR) – ITWissen](https://itwissen.info/en/signal-to-quantization-noise-ratio-SQNR.html)", "ttft_ms": 1887, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 12527, "ttft_stream_ms": 1629, "time_to_request_ms": 38, "first_content_frame_ms": 1630, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
